---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import heroImage from "../assets/Banner_SeniorSchool.png";
import PageSection from "../components/PageSection.astro";
import FramedImage from "../components/FramedImage.astro";
import SectionBreakLeaf from "../components/SectionBreakLeaf.astro";

import kivakamp1 from "../assets/kivakamp1.png";
import kivakamp2 from "../assets/kivakamp2.png";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={null} heroSrc={heroImage.src}>
  <PageSection
    title="PARENT ENGAGEMENT"
    headingLevel={2}
    contentWidth="narrow"
  >
    <div class="stack-lg">
      <p>
        The Parental Engagement Program aims to support the social emotional
        development of our students and encourage lifelong learning, through the
        active participation of our parent community. The goal is to establish
        shared responsibility, meaningful involvement and collaboration between
        parents and teachers for the healthy development of our students. As
        part of this initiative, parents are encouraged to participate in the
        events and meetings hosted by the school to create an active rapport
        between parents and teachers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </PageSection>

  <PageSection
    title="CHILDREN'S DAY CELEBRATION 2024"
    headingLevel={2}
    contentWidth="narrow"
  >
    <FramedImage imgSrc={kivakamp1.src} />
    <div class="stack-lg">
      <p>
        Nothing is more meaningful, than to have our parents cheer us on, while
        we get messy and explore with no inhibitions. Children's Day was a
        momentous occasion, where our parents facilitated and curated activities
        around graffiti art and tote bag screen printing for all the little
        stars at Kiva. Ending on a high note, grounding our energy, the event
        concluded with a Drum Circle, for parents and their children to enjoy
        with free abandon. Let's just say being messy and loud was a
        requirement!
      </p>
    </div>
  </PageSection>

  <SectionBreakLeaf />

  <PageSection
    title="STORY FEST 2025"
    headingLevel={2}
    contentWidth="narrow"
  >
    <FramedImage imgSrc={kivakamp2.src} />
    <div class="stack-lg">
      <p>
        Story Fest marked a momentous occasion at Kiva, whereby parents and
        teachers came together to plan, organize and execute a meticulous
        performance for our students. Titled, "Giraffes Can't Dance", based on
        the book by Giles Andreae, the enactment of this story was rich in
        lessons on finding your own tune and being compassionate and kind to
        those around you. An experience filled with rhythm, creativity and fun,
        Story Fest was the perfect blend of interactive storytelling. music and
        art put together by parents after a series of rehearsals on the school
        premises
      </p>
    </div>
  </PageSection>
</BaseLayout>
